[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3227742081","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110016#issuecomment-3227742081","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110016","id":3227742081,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AY2-B","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-27T10:58:32Z","updated_at":"2025-08-27T10:58:32Z","body":"Might be a path length issue, WSL image is mounted as SMB share and default SMB path limit is 255. The error is likely from loading shader cache, and cached file names are long, so it's trying to read something like (which is over the limit):\n```\n\\wsl.localhost\\Ubuntu-24.04\\home\\user\\workspace\\game\\Godot_tutorials\\godotintroduction\\.godot\\shader_cache\\Fsr2ReconstructPreviousDepthPassShaderRD\\015cc8470b5c57c96ffebd33e219fd06b5296f5b9d82f1ecb27063d60b59e514\\087916079fba7c625e62b0c2cca570e0fb87c99a.d3d12.cache\n```\n\nCheck is long path support registry setting / group policy is enabled, it should affect SMB share paths as well - https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/fileio/maximum-file-path-limitation?tabs=registry#registry-setting-to-enable-long-paths","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3227742081/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3240350192","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110016#issuecomment-3240350192","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110016","id":3240350192,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BI9Hw","user":{"login":"AkatsuyaTheOne","id":38074480,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MDc0NDgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38074480?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkatsuyaTheOne","html_url":"https://github.com/AkatsuyaTheOne","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkatsuyaTheOne/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkatsuyaTheOne/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkatsuyaTheOne/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkatsuyaTheOne/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkatsuyaTheOne/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkatsuyaTheOne/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkatsuyaTheOne/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkatsuyaTheOne/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkatsuyaTheOne/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-31T19:07:21Z","updated_at":"2025-08-31T19:07:21Z","body":"@bruvzg Ok, thank you for the hint. Closing this.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3240350192/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0